     "caption": "\ud83d\udc40 REVIEW: Polo Club holiday table reel, Wed 11/4 11am CT \u2014 reply yes/changes to Claude\n\ud83d\uded1 TIFFANY: DELETE THIS BOX BEFORE YOU POST \ud83d\uded1\nSong ideas (add in Instagram):\n1. \"Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas\" (Frank Sinatra), start at \"Have yourself a merry little Christmas\"\n2. \"The Christmas Song\" (Nat King Cole), start at \"Chestnuts roasting...\"\n3. \"It's Beginning to Look a Lot Like Christmas\" (Michael Bubl\u00e9), start at the title line\n4. \"Christmas (Baby Please Come Home)\" (Darlene Love), start at the chorus\nTag people: @ohmymahjong @bambirdboutique\nThe 7-frame story goes up right after (separate Planoly post, same day).\nDelete this box, then share.\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\nNo Christmas mat? No Christmas tiles? No problem. \ud83c\udf84\n\nThis is how I'm styling the Polo Club mat for the holidays: Heritage tiles, walnut racks, a hunter green cloth, a cognac coaster and a little Christmas tree ring dish for the dice.\n\nFor the center of the table, pick one: a little tree, a candle wreath, or a lamp with a velvet ribbon tied on. Which would you pick?\n\nComment and I'll send you the links. \ud83e\udd0d The whole table is on the blog too (link in bio).\n\nCode MAHJMATCH at Oh My Mahjong and Bam Bird Boutique.\n\n@ohmymahjong @bambirdboutique\n\n#ad #mahjong #mahjongtable #christmasmahjong #holidaymahjong #mahjongmat #mahjongtiles #holidaytablescape #mahjmatchmaker",
