     "caption": "\ud83d\udc40 REVIEW: Rackin' Rudolph holiday table reel, Fri 11/6 11am CT \u2014 reply yes/changes to Claude\n\ud83d\uded1 TIFFANY: DELETE THIS BOX BEFORE YOU POST \ud83d\uded1\nSong ideas (add in Instagram):\n1. \"Rudolph the Red-Nosed Reindeer\" (Gene Autry), start at \"Rudolph the red-nosed reindeer\"\n2. \"Run Rudolph Run\" (Chuck Berry), start at the chorus\n3. \"Santa Baby\" (Eartha Kitt), start at the title line\n4. \"All I Want for Christmas Is You\" (Mariah Carey), start at the first chorus\nTag people: @middleandmainmahjong\nThe 7-frame story goes up right after (separate Planoly post, same day).\nDelete this box, then share.\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\nHow I'm styling the Rackin' Rudolph mat. \ud83e\udd8c\ud83c\udf80\n\nCherry red cloth to match those bows, Rackin' Rudolph tiles (hello, cherry red backs), Middle & Main's scalloped milk glass racks, a little bow lamp whose bow echoes the bows on the mat, and a reindeer box for the dice.\n\nComment and I'll send you the links. \ud83e\udd0d The whole table is on the blog too (link in bio).\n\nCode MAHJMATCH at Hip Hip Mahjong and Middle & Main.\n\n@middleandmainmahjong\n\n#ad #mahjong #mahjongtable #rackinrudolph #christmasmahjong #holidaymahjong #mahjongmat #mahjongtiles #mahjmatchmaker",
